WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.632 --> 00:00:10.635
ENTRANCE

00:00:27.986 --> 00:00:29.154
Ouch!

00:00:30.405 --> 00:00:32.073
EMERGENCY EXIT

00:00:32.157 --> 00:00:35.326
ENTRANCE

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:41.332
Excuse me, has the Tokyo train left?

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:43.585
Was that your train?

00:00:43.668 --> 00:00:44.586
No...

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:54.220
Taeko Okajima, right?

00:00:54.679 --> 00:00:56.848
Yes, that's correct...

00:00:56.931 --> 00:00:58.850
Thank goodness.

00:00:58.933 --> 00:01:00.018
The car's this way.

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:03.063
Excuse me, but who are you?

00:01:03.605 --> 00:01:05.190
You don't remember?

00:01:05.482 --> 00:01:08.068
Of course you don't.

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:13.239
I'm Toshio. Kazuo's second cousin.

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:18.870
Oh, I see...

00:01:26.544 --> 00:01:28.046
What's so funny?

00:01:29.047 --> 00:01:31.257
Nothing. Sorry.

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:35.386
I thought you were trying to steal my bag.

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:42.310
That's terrible. Didn't I ask your name?

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:46.731
Yes, you did. I just thought... Sorry...

00:01:48.733 --> 00:01:50.777
I beg your pardon.

00:01:50.902 --> 00:01:51.903
No problem.

